\f3\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 keeping the model the same
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 , but giving it extra information at runtime.
\f1\fs28 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 You simply give it relevant information at the time of answering.\cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 \
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
