\f2\b\fs24 \AppleTypeServices CITATION
\f1\b0\fs28 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539  : 
\fs24 \AppleTypeServices \cf0 \strokec5 You cannot cite weights. Banking, healthcare, legal, and insurance all require traceability: "show me where it says that." RAG provides source IDs, page numbers, sections, and versions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 No Access Control in Weights - A model cannot know that user A may see the M&A folder and user B may not. Anything in the weights is available to anyone who can prompt the model. RAG enforces authorization at retrieval time, so the LLM only ever sees documents the requesting user is allowed to see.
