\f2\b Common problems : 
\f1\b0 Inconsistent tags (
\f7\fs26 \strokec5 UAE
\f1\fs24 \strokec5  vs 
\f7\fs26 \strokec5 AE
\f1\fs24 \strokec5  vs 
\f7\fs26 \strokec5 United Arab Emirates
\f1\fs24 \strokec5 ) causing silent filter misses; hallucinated LLM metadata; stale ACLs\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Don't think of metadata as "extra information attached to a chunk." Think of it as the control plane for your RAG system \'97 it enables retrieval filtering, security, freshness, provenance, governance, and operational debugging.\
