\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Semantic Chunking : 
\f1\b0 Embed each sentence, measure the similarity between consecutive sentences, and cut where the topic "jumps." \strokec5 The most common approach uses embedding distance thresholds, where you calculate the similarity between consecutive sentences and split the text when that similarity drops below a specific target.
