\ls20\ilvl0
\f1\b0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	
\f15 \uc0\u8259 
\f1 	}
\f8\b \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Step A (Centroid Search):
\f15\b0  When a new query vector arrives, the system calculates its distance against only the k cluster centroids to determine which clusters are geographically closest.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls20\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8259 	}
\f8\b \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Step B (Partition Probing): 
\f15\b0 Instead of scanning the entire database, the system isolates a user-defined number of the closest clusters (configured as nprobe) and performs a definitive search only within those subsets.\
\pard\tx720\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

