\f1\b0 \strokec5 \

\f2\b \strokec5 The analyzer pipeline
\f1\b0 \strokec5  runs identically on documents and queries: tokenize 
\f11 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  lowercase 
\f11 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  remove stopwords (optional) 
\f11 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  stem or lemmatize 
\f11 \uc0\u8594 
\f1  language-specific normalization. For Arabic, that means alef/yaa/taa-marbuta normalization and light stemming.
