\cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Fusion = combining results from multiple retrieval methods into one final ranked list.
\f1\b0 \

\f2\b 1. Score normalization + weighted sum  - 
\f1\b0 Retrieve candidates using multiple methods 
\f11 \strokec5 \uc0\u8594 
\f1 \strokec5  normalize their scores to a common scale 
\f11 \strokec5 \uc0\u8594 
\f1 \strokec5  assign importance (weights) to each retriever 
\f11 \strokec5 \uc0\u8594 
\f1 \strokec5  combine the scores 
\f11 \strokec5 \uc0\u8594 
\f1 \strokec5  rank the documents again. This is commonly used in Hybrid RAG .\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b \cf0 \outl0\strokewidth0 normalization type : \
