\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Hit Rate@K :  
\f1\b0 It answers a binary question: 
\f14\i\fs32 \strokec5 "Did the system find anything relevant at all within the top K results?"\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\i0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec5 	For each query or user, the score is 
\f10\b\fs32 \strokec5 1
