\f10\b\fs32 \strokec5 0
\f1\b0\fs24 \strokec5  (if none are).\
	The final Hit Rate@K across a test set is the average of these 0s and 1s, represented as a value between 
\f10\b\fs32 \strokec5 0.0 and 1.0
\f1\b0\fs24 \strokec5 .
\f14\i\fs32 \strokec5 \
